            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Miy Joisiraili cik me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.39+LEV.25.40+LEV.25.41+LEV.25.42+LEV.25.43+LEV.25.44+LEV.25.45+LEV.25.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jolevi 25:39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka winyewo ŋeca ma jacwo ma Jayuda, wotiy ma oro aucel, aka i oro mar'abirio wogonyi go m'ongoye cul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'inen munyo go lokere ŋeca oyido fodi k'onywomo, wokiri wokadhi gi dhako. To k'inen oyido nitie gi dhako, wokadhi gine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jadwoŋ pere omiyo go dhako to nywolo rigo yac kosa nyir, nyithindho no gi dhako jodoŋ apa jadwoŋ pere to jalo wokadhi kende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ŋeca no owaci kamaler ni, ‘Amaro jadwoŋ paran, dhako paran gi nyithindho paran. Akimiti wogonyan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo jadwoŋ pere wokel go ruwaŋ Were. Womiy go cungo i dhiot kosa i miango ma dhiot ma ot ma lamo to tuco ithe aka ŋeca no bino tiyo rigo i kwo pere je.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka nyatoro otana nyare paka ŋeca, kilagonyo go paka ŋeca ma jacwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'inen otana go gi jacwo ma mito loko go cege, to kucel jacwo no k'omaro go, wotana go gi bamere. Jadwoŋ pere kiripi kitana go gi jopath rupiri k'otero go g'adieri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro onyewo ŋeca madhako ri wode, ripo tero go paka nyare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka nyatoro onywomo dhako man, go ripo medirok gi miyo dhako pere marapena cemo gi nangin gi gima go ripo nwaŋo je i nywomirok paka dhako marapena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka go k'otimo gigipiny adek me rigo, wogonyi go m'ongoye cul ma pesa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik ma mako kwoŋ tim mar'akaka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
