          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kenyo ka go obothi to doko cako kicera cera gi luth, ŋat'ogoyo go no ripo culo go ri hola pere m'onyeko, to miyo go kony cuka both.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
