        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka nyatoro ogoy ŋeca pere, madhako kosa jacwo gi luth to ŋeca no tho i cinge, iripo miyo go gir'acula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ŋeca no otho rumacen ma ndelo kosa ario, wokiri womiy go gir'acula rupiri ŋeca no obedo lim pere won.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ji jogore to jomiyo dhako ma yac litho to iye podho woko to ngoye litho man, ŋat'omiyo go litho iripo kitanza go gima cwor dhako no okethi kwoŋe cungo kwoŋ yerok pa jothum banja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka dhako won am'omiyo go litho, kenyo gir'acula wobedi kwo ri kwo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waŋ ri waŋ, lak ri lak, cingi ri cingi, tiendi ri tiendi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waŋ ri waŋ, adhola ri adhola, aka gwarok ri gwarok.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
